OL,2,Wj5{5jj5s1FGOVT FORCES RESIST
OL,3,W/*%/,$/..%,.%FUN CEASEFIRE MOVES
OL,4,G`````````````
OL,5,FThe Bosnian government is said to be
OL,6,Fresisting efforts by the United Nations
OL,7,Fto arrange a formal ceasefire in and
OL,8,Faround the capital Sarajevo.
OL,9,F
OL,10, It is believed recent victories over
OL,11, the Bosnian Serbs have made the Bosnian
OL,12, government and Croats so confident that
OL,13, they are refusing to consider a truce.
OL,15, The UN commander in Bosnia General
OL,16, Rupert Smith, says planned talks to
OL,17, arrange a ceasefire have been abandoned
OL,19, The UN estimates that the government
OL,20, and Croat armies now control more than
OL,21, half the country following successful
OL,22, offensives in North western Bosnia.
OL,23,F]DFrom 18-09-95   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,180,120,250,0,100
PN,18104
SC,0004
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1789686235
OL,1,Wpp0                               G4/11
OL,2,Wj5{5jj5s1FUN SHOULD PULL OUT
OL,3,W/*%/,$/..%,.%FOF BOSNIA - BOUTROS-GHALI
OL,4,G`````````````
OL,5,FThe UN Secretary General has told the
OL,6,FSecurity Council that he wants the UN
OL,7,Fto disengage militarily from Bosnia and
OL,8,Fleave responsibility for peace to NATO.
OL,9,F
OL,10, Dr Boutros Boutros-Ghali said that
OL,11, regardless of whether there is a peace
OL,12, agreement in the former Yugoslavia, he
OL,13, would recommend that the peacekeeping
OL,14, aspects of the UN force be terminated.
OL,16, NATO says the Serbs are continuing to
OL,17, pull back their heavy weapons from
OL,18, Sarajevo, but has warned airstrikes
OL,19, will resume on Wednesday if the
OL,20, withdrawal is not completed.
OL,22,F```````````````````````````````````````
OL,23,V]DFrom 18-09-95   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
