OL,2,Wj5{5jj5s1FTV3 MOVE TO SET
OL,3,W/*%/,$/..%,.%FUP THIRD CHANNEL
OL,4,G`````````````
OL,5,FThe TV3 consortium has announced that
OL,6,Fit is to develop the franchise for the
OL,7,FRepublic's third television channel in
OL,8,Fpartnership with UTV.
OL,10, The consortium's promoters said that
OL,11, along with UTV they would be entering
OL,12, into talks with the IRTC to finalise
OL,13, the concept for the establishment of
OL,14, the station.
OL,16, The channel's backers say that their
OL,17, proposals include a national dedicated
OL,18, news and current affairs service
OL,19, providing news and comment from the
OL,20, whole of Ireland and internationally.
OL,22, They say their schedule will be based
OL,23, around news, comment & entertainment.
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,180,120,250,0,100
PN,18111
SC,0011
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1789686235
OL,1,Wpp0                              G11/11
OL,2,Wj5{5jj5s1FSF/UDP ADDRESS
OL,3,W/*%/,$/..%,.%FLIBERAL DEMOCRAT MEETING
OL,4,G`````````````
OL,5,FRepresentatives of Sinn Fein and the
OL,6,FLoyalist UDP shared a public platform
OL,7,Ffor the first time during a fringe
OL,8,Fmeeting of the Liberal democrats
OL,9,Fconference in Glasgow today.
OL,11, As the impasse over decommissioning of
OL,12, weapons continues, Sinn Fein chairman
OL,13, Mitchel McLaughlin said all party
OL,14, discussions were the only way forward.
OL,16, He said that the opportunity for
OL,17, progress would be missed if the British
OL,18, Government does not engage in dialogue.
OL,20, Gary McMichael of the UDP said parties
OL,21, in the North had a responsibility to
OL,22, build on common ground.
